# Keeps the server image build context small and out of the host's own
# state: a node_modules built for the host's OS/arch, a stale Next build, the
# git history, the Next-only public assets and docs, none of which the game
# server touches at runtime.
#
# Anchored the same way .gitignore is: an unanchored `data` would also match
# `packages/data`, the Drizzle package the server needs to boot.
/node_modules
node_modules/
/.next
/.git
/public
/docs
/data
